  "question": "What fast food restaurant exist within a 100 kilometers distance along the way to the Potted Plant Inc., Scottsdale, AZ from Barrett, the Honors College at ASU, Tempe, AZ?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.927437 33.415436)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.920729 33.631545)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.927437 33.415436)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.927437 33.415436)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
